  description: "Target 1 \"Amazement\" monster you control or 1 face-up monster your
    opponent controls; equip this card to it. You can activate the following effect,
    based on which player controls the equipped monster;\r\n\u25CF You: Target 1
    card in your opponent's GY; change the equipped monster's battle position, and
    if you do, shuffle that target into the Deck.\r\n\u25CF Your opponent: Increase
    the equipped monster's Level by 1 (until the end of this turn), and if you do,
    change its battle position.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Amaze Attraction
    Rapid Racing\" once per turn."
